[PrintTextModified Text:すぐ横で嫌な音がした。|#0201Bad01_Narrative108| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureNanoka.0-4
